        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Opulent/mission_stingray/scene_stingray_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 232b3a9a-6630-4738-bdb9-65bd3f844966).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Haven Island, 47.\r\rYour targets are three indispensible members of the tech crew working at HAVEN&apos;s secret underground facility. The client would like to set HAVEN&apos;s operation back a few months, and this is the most effective way to do just that. The client has also requested that these hits be made to look like the work of a known serial killer, whose MO was to use a fishing hook to murder his victims. A little unorthodox, but I&apos;m sure you can oblige.\r\rHappy hunting.",
